# WebRTC (goi thoai/video chu nuoi <-> bac si). Server chi lam tong dai/chuyen tin hieu
# qua Socket.IO namespace /messaging; am thanh/hinh anh di thang giua hai trinh duyet.
#
# STUN du cho may cung mang hoac NAT thong thuong (mac dinh: stun.l.google.com:19302).
WEBRTC_STUN_URLS=stun:stun.l.google.com:19302
#
# Ra Internet that (4G, NAT doi xung) can TURN. Bo trong neu chua co may chu TURN.
# Vi du coturn: turn:turn.example.com:3478?transport=udp,turns:turn.example.com:5349
WEBRTC_TURN_URLS=
WEBRTC_TURN_USERNAME=
WEBRTC_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
